 "2. Untuk apa data dipakai": "2. How data is used",
 "Menjalankan fitur: masuk, deploy ke platform pilihanmu, mengelola domain dan environment variables, menayangkan Link Instan.": "Running features: signing in, deploying to the platform you choose, managing domains and environment variables, and serving Instant Links.",
