 "Segitiga kecil bertaburan dengan rotasi acak.": "Small triangles scattered at random angles.",
 "Coretan": "Scribble",
 "Satu garis lengkung seperti coretan tangan.": "A single curved line like a hand-drawn scribble.",
 "Mentah: sudut lancip, garis tebal hitam, judul raksasa kapital, tanpa bayangan halus, elemen dirapatkan.": "Raw: sharp corners, thick black lines, giant uppercase titles, no soft shadows, tightly packed elements.",
 "Brutalism yang lebih ramah: bayangan kotak geser warna-warni, sudut membulat, judul besar, grid rapat.": "Friendlier brutalism: colorful offset box shadows, rounded corners, big titles, a tight grid.",
 "Kolom konten lebih sempit & lega, jarak antar section lapang, label kapital renggang — tipografi jadi fokus.": "Narrower, airy content columns, generous section spacing, wide-spaced uppercase labels — typography takes center stage.",
 "Kartu kotak tegas berdampingan dengan tombol bulat penuh — kontras bentuk geometris khas Bauhaus.": "Crisp square cards next to fully round buttons — the geometric contrast Bauhaus is known for.",
 "Serba membulat & mengilap, judul besar bergradasi warna, kartu lega, dekorasi gelembung lembut di latar.": "Rounded and glossy everywhere, big gradient titles, roomy cards, soft bubble decorations in the background.",
 "Kartu kaca buram lega tembus pandang di atas gelembung warna blur. Paling terlihat di Template/Warna gelap.": "Roomy frosted-glass cards over blurred color blobs. Most visible with dark Templates/colors.",
 "Tanpa garis tepi sama sekali, kartu longgar berjarak supaya bayangan ganda terbaca — elemen terasa timbul dari latar.": "No borders at all, loosely spaced cards so the double shadows read clearly — elements seem to rise from the background.",
 "Futuristik": "Futuristic",
 "Kolom lebar, grid rapat teknis, garis tegas, grid halus menyala di beberapa bagian, judul besar kapital renggang.": "Wide columns, a tight technical grid, crisp lines, faint glowing grids in some sections, big wide-spaced uppercase titles.",
 "Kolom paling sempit, jarak antar section paling lapang — whitespace maksimal, judul lebih kecil & ramping.": "The narrowest columns and the most generous section spacing — maximum whitespace, smaller, slimmer titles.",
 "Judul paling besar & berani, kartu lega tak beraturan, gelembung warna blur di beberapa bagian, bayangan lembut.": "The biggest, boldest titles, roomy irregular cards, blurred color blobs in some sections, soft shadows.",
 "Kartu": "Cards",
